<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ITT Industries started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ITT Industries started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber started coverage of ITT Industries Inc as attractive, a PaineWebber source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 5/8 to 24 in early morning exchange trade.</p>
</text>
